00:25:45.680 --> 00:25:47.209
please leave it down in the comments below

00:25:47.209 --> 00:25:48.301
and I'll see what I can do.

00:25:48.301 --> 00:25:50.041
I'd also love to know your
thoughts on this video.

00:25:50.041 --> 00:25:51.457
What was your favorite clip?

00:25:51.457 --> 00:25:53.982
What is going to inspire you
to leave your comfort zone?

00:25:53.982 --> 00:25:56.252
Do you have any thoughts,
suggestions, tips

00:25:56.252 --> 00:25:58.240
that you'd like to add from
your own experience as well.

00:25:58.240 --> 00:26:00.065
Please leave it down
in the comments below.

00:26:00.065 --> 00:26:01.714
I'm excited to see what you have to say.

