00:26:07.247 --> 00:26:10.048
and making that fine
Youtube video on it as well.

00:26:10.048 --> 00:26:11.904
I really, really, really
appreciate the support

00:26:11.904 --> 00:26:13.574
and I'm glad you enjoyed the book.

00:26:13.574 --> 00:26:14.848
So thank you guys again for watching.

00:26:14.848 --> 00:26:16.107
I believe in you.

00:26:16.107 --> 00:26:18.135
I hope you continue to believe in yourself

00:26:18.135 --> 00:26:20.038
